@SupportAPI_HostAddress = https://localhost:8080
@accessToken = paste-access-token-here
@requestId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

POST {{SupportAPI_HostAddress}}/api/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Example support request",
  "requestContent": "Describe the problem here."
}

###

GET {{SupportAPI_HostAddress}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json
